e":"會稽思世子道生，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及孝武帝即位，嘗晝日見道生及臨川獻王郁，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王錄玄孫珣之為後。珣之曆吳興太守。劉裕之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與梁王珍之俱被害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0114","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0111"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"原詞玄孫；中間代未由本句點名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0114","surface":"珣之","start":114,"end":116,"person_id":"1gr_agz_a4h","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p016:m0208","surface":"司馬珣之","start":208,"end":212,"person_id":"1gr_agz_a4h","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p016","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin064-xunzhi-ancestor","subject_person_id":"1gr_agz_a4h","object_person_id":"tph_dpd_6m5","predicate":"ancestor","qualifiers":{"source_term":"西陽王錄玄孫珣之"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simadaosheng-ws2622004","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","quote":"會稽思世子道生，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及孝武帝即位，嘗晝日見道生及臨川獻王郁，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王錄玄孫珣之為後。珣之曆吳興太守。劉裕之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與梁王珍之俱被害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0114","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0111"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"原詞玄孫；中間代未由本句點名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001","text":"會稽思世子道生，字延長。帝為會稽王，立道生為世子，拜散騎侍郎、給事中。性疏躁，不修行業，多失禮度，竟以幽廢而卒，時年二十四，無後。及孝武帝即位，嘗晝日見道生及臨川獻王郁，鬱曰：「大郎饑乏辛苦。」言竟不見。帝傷感，因以西陽王錄玄孫珣之為後。珣之曆吳興太守。劉裕之伐關中，以為諮議參軍。時帝道方謝，珣之為宗室之美，與梁王珍之俱被害。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":106,"last_line":106,"raw_start":7099,"raw_end":7265,"raw_character_offsets":[7101,7102,7103,7104,7105,7106,7107,7108,7109,7110,7111,7112,7113,7114,7115,7116,7117,7118,7119,7120,7121,7122,7123,7124,7125,7126,7127,7128,7129,7130,7131,7132,7133,7134,7135,7136,7137,7138,7139,7140,7141,7142,7143,7144,7145,7146,7147,7148,7149,7150,7151,7152,7153,7154,7155,7156,7157,7158,7159,7160,7161,7162,7163,7164,7165,7166,7167,7168,7169,7170,7171,7172,7173,7174,7175,7176,7177,7178,7179,7180,7181,7182,7183,7184,7185,7186,7187,7188,7189,7190,7191,7192,7193,7194,7195,7196,7197,7198,7199,7200,7201,7202,7203,7204,7205,7206,7207,7208,7209,7210,7211,7212,7213,7214,7215,7216,7217,7218,7219,7220,7221,7222,7223,7224,7225,7226,7227,7228,7229,7230,7231,7232,7233,7234,7235,7236,7237,7238,7239,7240,7241,7242,7243,7244,7245,7246,7247,7248,7249,7250,7251,7252,7253,7254,7255,7256,7257,7258,7259,7260,7261,7262,7263,7264],"revision_id":2622004},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0000","surface":"會稽思世子道生","start":0,"end":7,"person_id":"k9q_h4e_j2q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0066","surface":"孝武帝","start":66,"end":69,"person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0079","surface":"臨川獻王郁","start":79,"end":84,"person_id":"70z_zog_t15","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0111","surface":"錄","start":111,"end":112,"person_id":"tph_dpd_6m5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0114","surface":"珣之","start":114,"end":116,"person_id":"1gr_agz_a4h","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0127","surface":"劉裕","start":127,"end":129,"person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng:p001:m0156","surface":"梁王珍之","start":156,"end":160,"person_id":"hxp_cd6_qcl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaosheng","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simadaosheng-ws2622004"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p016","text":"及玄敗，大將軍、武陵王遵承旨下令曰：「故太傅公阿衡二世，契闊皇家，親賢之重，地無與二。驃騎大將軍內總朝維，外宣威略，志蕩世難，以甯國祚。天未靜亂，禍酷備鐘，悲動區宇，痛貫人鬼，感惟永往，心情崩隕。今皇祚反正，幽顯式敘，宜崇明國體，以述舊典。便可追崇太傅為丞相，加殊禮，一依安平獻王故事。追贈驃騎為太尉，加羽葆鼓吹。丞相填塋翳然，飄薄非所，須南道清通，便奉迎神柩。太尉宜便遷改。可下太史祥吉日，定宅兆。」於是遣通直常侍司馬珣之迎道子柩于安成。時寇賊未平，喪不時達。義熙元年，合葬于王妃陵。追諡元顯曰忠。以臨川王寶子修之為道子嗣，尊妃王氏為太妃。義熙中，有稱元顯子秀熙避難蠻中而至者，太妃請以為嗣，於是修之歸於別第。劉裕意其詐而案驗之，果散騎郎滕羨奴勺藥也，竟坐棄市。太妃不悟，哭之甚慟。修之復為嗣。薨，諡悼王，無子，國除。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":143,"last_line":143,"raw_start":12215,"raw_end":12584,"raw_character_offsets":[12217,12218,12219,12220,12221,12222,12223,12224,12225,12226,12227,12228,12229,12230,12231,12232,12233,12234,12235,12236,12237,12238,12239,12240,12241,12242,12243,12244,12245,12246,12247,12248,12249,12250,12251,12252,12253,12254,12255,12256,12257,12258,12259,12260,12261,12262,12263,12264,12265,12266,12267,12268,12269,12270,12271,12272,12273,12274,12275,12276,12277,12278,12279,12280,12281,12282,12283,12284,12285,12286,12287,12288,12289,12290,12291,12292,12293,12294,12295,12296,12297,12298,12299,12300,12301,12302,12303,12304,12305,12306,12307,12308,12309,12310,12311,12312,12313,12314,12315,12316,12317,12318,12319,12320,12321,12322,12323,12324,12325,12326,12327,12328,12329,12330,12331,12332,12333,12334,12335,12336,12337,12338,12339,12340,12341,12342,12343,12344,12